---
title: Raisin Sauce
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Sauces & Dressings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@brown sugar{1/2%c}
@corn starch{2%Tbsp}
@dry mustard{1%tsp}
@vinegar{2%Tbsp}
@lemon juice{2%Tbsp}
@water{1.5%c}
@lemon peel{1/4%tsp}
@raisins{1/2%c}

Mix and slowly add 2 Tbsp of vinegar. Add: @lemon juice{2%Tbsp}, @water{1.5%c}, @lemon peel{1/4%tsp}, and @raisins{1/2%c}. Stir over low heat until thick.
